WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.390
Biochemistrypedia is a free biology site, from molecules to ecosystems.

2
00:00:06.041 --> 00:00:12.631
It now has 354 lessons in 11 courses, with 464 short films.

3
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.860
This fall it added two courses written to Virginia's standards:

4
00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:19.920
grade 7 Life Science and high school Biology.

5
00:00:20.765 --> 00:00:23.545
Each lesson starts from something students can observe,

6
00:00:23.585 --> 00:00:27.555
and includes a simulation, a film, and real data,

7
00:00:27.825 --> 00:00:29.535
much of it from the Chesapeake Bay.

8
00:00:30.307 --> 00:00:33.287
A switch lets each student choose how much help they get,

9
00:00:33.327 --> 00:00:35.077
while the task stays the same.

10
00:00:35.712 --> 00:00:38.702
Each lesson also shows where its idea sits,

11
00:00:38.832 --> 00:00:40.602
from seventh grade through college.

12
00:00:41.352 --> 00:00:43.542
There is no account and no advertising.

13
00:00:44.257 --> 00:00:46.507
Content is fact-checked before release,

14
00:00:46.837 --> 00:00:48.987
every page has a way to report an error,

15
00:00:49.317 --> 00:00:51.087
and corrections are made within days.

16
00:00:51.994 --> 00:00:53.124
The aim is simple:

17
00:00:53.414 --> 00:00:56.984
a student's preparation should not depend on what their family can pay.
